&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As an Associate on the Client Service team, you will understand your client’s unique business questions and identify the experts who can best provide the answers. You will find and recruit new experts into our network of over 1,250,000 Guidepoint Advisors, determining which ones are best suited to speak with the client. For many of our employees, the Associate role provides a unique opportunity to put core business skills into practice, as well as gain exposure to a wide range of industries and disciplines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW167937247 BCX2&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167937247 BCX2&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid position out of our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167937247 BCX2&quot;&gt;Athens &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167937247 BCX2&quot;&gt;office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167937247 BCX2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
